The full licence text is chrome_plugin/LICENSE.txt. Bundled third-party components keep
their own licences, found next to them (for example
chrome_plugin/platform/mv3/extension/lib/codemirror/codemirror-ubol/LICENSE and
chrome_plugin/platform/mv3/extension/lib/s14e-serializer/LICENSE).

ThankMu's own changes to chrome_plugin/ are released under the same GPLv3 terms.

Source availability: the complete corresponding source for each released version of the
extension is published alongside that release, as one squashed commit tagged chrome-vX.Y.Z
in the public source repository the extension's About pane offers. That location is
thankmu/targets.json store.source_url; see ADR-013 "Source publication"
(docs/architecture/adr-013-plugin-fork-base.md in the ThankMu tracking repo).

The ThankMu API and services are separate, proprietary software and are not part of this repository.
